; =====================================================
; FILE: research
; PURPOSE:
;   Researches shared non-unit upgrades and important tech bundles.
;
; =====================================================
; *** Table of Contents *** 
; =====================================================
;
;	Chapter 0: SETUP
;	Chapter 1: GLOBAL PRIORITY
